  "description": "Compact, traceable RNA, DNA, protein, single-cell, genomic interval and synthetic paired-read taxonomy benchmarks with offline scoring and verifiable reports. Version 10 adds result discovery for checked workspaces and a Python API for catalog queries, verified file access, workspace preparation and scoring. Discovery routes supported pipeline outputs, checks required headers, reports ambiguity and writes a hash-locked index before grading. The mock taxonomy fixture uses project-local codes and does not measure biological classification accuracy. Browse the public collection catalog or install from PyPI.",
